WEBVTT

00:05:28.525 --> 00:05:30.293
And here's how we know that.

00:05:30.327 --> 00:05:32.796
I want to give you guys five numbers.

00:05:32.829 --> 00:05:34.297
Five.

00:05:34.331 --> 00:05:35.999
Seven.

00:05:36.032 --> 00:05:37.667
46.

00:05:37.701 --> 00:05:38.969
23

00:05:39.002 --> 00:05:40.270
and one.

00:05:40.303 --> 00:05:43.940
And no, it's not
the Mega Millions jackpot numbers.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:45.675
See, for more than five decades,

00:05:45.709 --> 00:05:49.012
this country has waged a war on drugs,

00:05:49.045 --> 00:05:53.250
which has been tantamount to waging
a war on Black and brown communities.

00:05:53.283 --> 00:05:56.186
Millions of people have been arrested,

00:05:56.219 --> 00:06:00.757
convicted and incarcerated
for marijuana-related possessions.